    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:text "name: implementation-django\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b3>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b4> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2869, djr:R-2870 ;
    djr:text "description: Django 코어 구현 지식 — 모델·ORM·QuerySet/Manager, 마이그레이션, 서비스·셀렉터 레이어, 트랜잭션 경계, 설정·미들웨어·캐싱·보안·시그널, 트랜잭셔널 outbox 구현. Django 모델·ORM·서비스 레이어·트랜잭션 코드를 새로 작성하거나 리팩터링할 때 먼저 로드한다. 표현계층(템플릿/폼/HTMX)은 implementation-django-web, JSON API는 implementation-django-ninja, 신규 REST 계약은 architecture-api로 위임.\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:text "user-invocable: false\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s001> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-prose ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:text "---\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 언제 쓰나"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2871 ;
    djr:text "\nDjango 코어(모델·ORM·서비스 레이어·트랜잭션·설정·마이그레이션·시그널·캐싱·보안) 코드를 설계·작성할 때 로드한다. 경계:\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2872 ;
    djr:text "- 서버렌더 표현계층(뷰=어댑터·템플릿·웹폼·HTMX/CSRF) → `implementation-django-web`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2873 ;
    djr:text "- JSON API 어댑터(Router/Schema) → `implementation-django-ninja`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2874 ;
    djr:text "- 신규 REST API 계약 설계 → `architecture-api`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2875 ;
    djr:text "- 도메인 전략·애그리거트·도메인이벤트 채택 → `architecture-ddd`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 6 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2876 ;
    djr:text "- DB 신뢰성·인덱스·트랜잭션 격리·outbox 전달 보장 → `architecture-db`\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003/b7> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s003> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 7 ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2877 ;
    djr:text "- Python 관용구 → `implementation-python`, 클린코드 원칙 → `discipline-cleancode`\n\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> a djr:Section ;
    djr:headingSnapshot "## 핵심 운영 원칙"@ko ;
    djr:inDocument <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#d/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md> ;
    djr:sectionOwner djr:owner-graph .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b1> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 1 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/architecture-ddd/references/final.md/s017-3.2/b9>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s024-4.1/b2> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2878, djr:R-2879 ;
    djr:text "\n- 비즈니스 로직은 뷰가 아니라 모델·도메인에 — 평면 Django 맥락은 fat model(§4.1), dddjango 표준 4계층은 `domain_layer` 애그리거트 소유(`architecture-ddd` §3.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b2> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 2 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s075-16.1/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2880 ;
    djr:text "- 서비스 레이어 도입 시점과 HackSoft service/selector 패턴 (§16.1–§16.2)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b3> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 3 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b1>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s078-16.4/b7> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2881, djr:R-2882 ;
    djr:text "- 트랜잭션·일관성 경계는 `transaction.atomic()`, 외부 부수효과는 `transaction.on_commit()` (§16.4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b4> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 4 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s079-16.5/b1> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2883 ;
    djr:text "- 메시지 유실이 불가하면 트랜잭셔널 outbox로 구현 (§16.5 — 채택 기준 `architecture-ddd` §3.7, 전달 보장 `architecture-db` §9.7)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b5> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
    djr:kind djr:kind-norm ;
    djr:order 5 ;
    djr:restates <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b2>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b4>, <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/references/final.md/s015-2.5/b5> ;
    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2884, djr:R-2885, djr:R-2886, djr:R-2887 ;
    djr:text "- Choices 계층 소유: 도메인 상태 값 집합은 domain Enum 파생(TextChoices 자체 선언은 순수 인프라 필드 한정), `default=`는 `.value` 평탄화, 비교·`.filter()`는 심볼로만 (§2.5, 마이그레이션 동결 §10.4)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b6> a djr:Block ;
    djr:inSection <https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004> ;
