    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2888 ;
    djr:text "- QuerySet 최적화·N+1 방지는 selector/QuerySet 메서드로 (§5, §11.1)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b7> a djr:Block ;
