    djr:statesNorm djr:R-2889 ;
    djr:text "- 마이그레이션은 안전·무중단 순서 준수 (§10)\n"@ko .

<https://numchida.com/ns/djr#s/dddjango/skills/implementation-django/SKILL.md/s004/b8> a djr:Block ;
